(7730699, 1273379, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> just looking at your camera settings .. did you create that wonderful effect in your editing .. if you did that''s even better .. a very creative and inspired image .. :) </i></td></tr></table> Thank you Roz for the kind words. You are absolutely right, I added radial blur in Photoshop, just wanted the tram to stand out more agains a very busy background. But I''m still not sure if it was worth it, though, I''m generally not a big fan of such modifications... <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by roz: just looking at your camera settings .. did you create that wonderful effect in your editing .. if you did that''s even better .. a very creative and inspired image .. :)  Thank you Roz for the kind words. You are absolutely right, I added radial blur in Photoshop, just wanted the tram to stand out more agains a very busy background. But I''m still not sure if it was worth it, though, I''m generally not a big fan of such modifications... ', '2022-10-05 13:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
