(7730712, 1273379, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> just looking at your camera settings .. did you create that wonderful effect in your editing .. if you did that''s even better .. a very creative and inspired image .. :) </i></td></tr></table> Thank you Roz for the kind words. You are absolutely right, I added radial blur in Photoshop, just wanted the tram to stand out more agains a very busy background. But I''m still not sure if it was worth it, though, I''m generally not a big fan of such modifications... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>it appears your opinion was shared by a few of the voters judging by breakdown .. ie. the low votes .. <br/>I think any departure that strays too far from the original .. especially in a standard edit .. will get very divided opinions .. <br/>I''m a big fan of departing from the original .. lol .. especially if the resulting image wow''s me in some way ..<br/> <br/>it looks like you wow''ed lots of voters because of your decision ..  <br/>would be great to know how it would have gone in the challenge without the radial blur.. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Originally posted by roz: just looking at your camera settings .. did you create that wonderful effect in your editing .. if you did that''s even better .. a very creative and inspired image .. :)  Thank you Roz for the kind words. You are absolutely right, I added radial blur in Photoshop, just wanted the tram to stand out more agains a very busy background. But I''m still not sure if it was worth it, though, I''m generally not a big fan of such modifications...   it appears your opinion was shared by a few of the voters judging by breakdown .. ie. the low votes .. I think any departure that strays too far from the original .. especially in a standard edit .. will get very divided opinions .. I''m a big fan of departing from the original .. lol .. especially if the resulting image wow''s me in some way .. it looks like you wow''ed lots of voters because of your decision ..  would be great to know how it would have gone in the challenge without the radial blur.. :) ', '2022-10-05 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 0),
